Package: libbsm
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Essential: yes
Priority: required
Depends: libsystem
Description: BSM audit library
 OpenBSM's library for creating and interpreting BSM audit records,
 with audit token accessors and the upstream manual pages.

Package: libbsm-dev
Section: libdevel
Priority: optional
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: libbsm (= ${binary:Version})
Description: BSM audit library: development files
 Public OpenBSM headers for building programs against libbsm.
 Kernel audit headers are supplied by xnu.

Package: auditd
Section: admin
Priority: important
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Depends: libbsm (= ${binary:Version}), libsystem, blueberry-pie-os-init (>= 2)
Recommends: logger
Breaks: libbsm (<< 21+ds3-1)
Replaces: libbsm (<< 21+ds3-1)
Description: BSM audit daemon and tools
 auditd writes the kernel's audit records to the trail in /var/audit,
 and expires old trail files. audit controls auditd. praudit prints
 audit records, and auditreduce selects them. The audit configuration
 is in /etc/security.
